nputUsdPerMTok}/MTok, output $${actualPrice.outputUsdPerMTok}/MTok` : 'not present in the attempt ledger or current configuration'}`,\n     `- Pricing note: ${clean(row.priceNote ?? tier?.priceNote ?? 'No price provenance note was recorded.', 700)}`,\n@@ -112,3 +122,6 @@\n     '## Repricing guidance',\n-    'For a first-order comparison using the same token mix, estimate USD as (uncached input tokens × input USD/MTok + cached input tokens × cached-input USD/MTok + output tokens × output USD/MTok) ÷ 1,000,000. Use each model’s configured rates below. This excludes provider-specific discounts, cache creation unless the recorded price note accounts for it, subscription billing, and other unmeasured charges. Tally ceilings remain the enforced per-attempt limit.',\n+    'For a first-order comparison using the same token mix, estimate USD as (uncached input × input USD/MTok + cached input × cached-input USD/MTok + output × output USD/MTok + cache creation, when reported, at Tally’s configured 1.25× (5-minute) or 2× (1-hour) input rate) ÷ 1,000,000. The calculated alternatives below use Tally’s configured per-model rates and the recorded token mix. These are normalized list-price estimates, not provider invoices; they exclude provider-specific discounts, subscription billing, and other unmeasured charges. Tally ceilings remain the enforced per-attempt limit.',\n+    '',\n+    '### Same-token-mix alternatives',\n+    ...(tokensReported ? input.tiers.map(configured => `- ${clean(configured.name, 80)} / ${clean(configured.model, 120)}: ${usd(repriceTokenUsage(row.tokens, configured.price))} at the configured list rates (${clean(configured.provider, 60)}). This reprices this attempt’s tokens; it does not claim the alternative model would produce the same output or pass verification.`) : ['No measured token counts were reported for this attempt, so Tally cannot calculate a grounded model-rate comparison.']),\n     '',\n@@ -124,2 +137,3 @@\n     `- cfo.ai tier-spend table: ${safeLink(input.spendTableUrl) ?? 'not recorded'}`,\n+    `- cfo.ai scenario context page: ${safeLink(input.contextPageUrl) ?? 'not recorded'}`,\n     '',\n@@ -141,2 +155,3 @@\n       repository: clean(input.repo, 200),\n+      ...(input.scenario ? { scenario: clean(input.scenario, 160) } : {}),\n       tier: clean(row.tier, 100),\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /tmp/tally-final-onboarding-20261012/adapters/cfoai-context.ts\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1791808955587,"completed_at_ms":1791808955587}}
