{"timestamp":"2026-10-12T12:55:22.123Z","ordinal":24140,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_04290251e26d63f4016accd8b769848191989bbb3f32f82a8e","status":"completed","call_id":"call_b1921e497a3d41b7a267ee9102087829","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /tmp/tally-final-onboarding-20261012/docs/GETTING_STARTED.md\\n@@\\n **cfo.ai:** Tally uses built-in MCP OAuth, so no separate cfo.ai CLI/package install is needed. If not connected, init offers browser login. Select your workspace and scenario from the numbered choices, or press Enter to skip. It checks the budget and spend tables. Before creating any missing table, init shows the workspace, scenario, rows, starting values, and formula in a readable proposal and asks for approval. It does not reset existing tables or model data. An incomplete connection falls back to local budgeting. `tally login cfoai` can reconnect later. After table setup, you may separately opt in to an explanatory note on the scenario page and organization-scoped Ari task reports. These give Ari the per-attempt model, token/cost assumptions, result, budget snapshot, and review links needed for spend questions and model what-ifs. They are shared with the selected workspace and exclude issue bodies, prompts, source, transcripts, raw trace contents, and credentials. Dry runs never publish these reports.\\n+\\n+To verify Ari's context in a demo, ask for a task's spend and route by issue number, compare the same recorded tokens at another configured tier's rates, and ask for the monthly budget remaining at the report's snapshot time. A grounded answer should cite the attempt/run, show the rate and token assumptions, distinguish estimates from provider invoices, and say when data is missing. A same-token what-if is a price comparison; it does not establish that another model would have produced the same result.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1300b-17e6-7e20-bf7a-c9594d868dc3","create_time":1791809719.4139333}}}
